...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
plane: 컨트롤 플레인 { class: ext }
os: AgentOS 서버 { class: ours }
team: 팀 리더 (Team) { class: ours }
openai: OpenAI gpt-4o { class: ext }

user -> plane: 질문 입력
plane -> os: "POST /teams/{id}/runs"
os -> team: arun(질문)
team -> openai: 지시문 · 멤버 명단 · 질문\n+ delegate_task_to_member 스키마
openai -> team: delegate_task_to_member(\nfinance-agent, task)
